{"steam_appid":3412160,"steam_name":"The House Always Wins","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3412160/1953187938/e94df5995a4c18e2e7b60beada869996159a5df6/1785516962/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785942156","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257389353/57af3d97d68deaf3de119628cd42d3bf487e6777/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785942156","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/2a1189d6f4a7341e1efdf741feef53d1ea3c4365/ss_2a1189d6f4a7341e1efdf741feef53d1ea3c4365.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785944700","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/49c56d70b538a6536ace949849635ebe623e695a/ss_49c56d70b538a6536ace949849635ebe623e695a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785944700","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/3e2958168c388e93c3e30bb104e19f3087c33881/ss_3e2958168c388e93c3e30bb104e19f3087c33881.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785944700","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/f8f83b11272e9bf4eae6c2e767da7d26991b0097/ss_f8f83b11272e9bf4eae6c2e767da7d26991b0097.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785944700","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/6483f9ade41b75472fce7bbeb2584330d04d77a8/ss_6483f9ade41b75472fce7bbeb2584330d04d77a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785944700"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HILARIOUS CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/ecd2854c1152c8f888c0de168074919d.poster.avif?t=1785944700\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/ecd2854c1152c8f888c0de168074919d.webm?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/ecd2854c1152c8f888c0de168074919d.mp4?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every guest is here to play nice. Deal with expressive graffiti artists, crazy goose, careless smokers and guests from outer space. Show must go on!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR BUSINESS SOLO OR IN CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/470055a0f970c3ad4972935ab5c7f83f.poster.avif?t=1785944700\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/470055a0f970c3ad4972935ab5c7f83f.webm?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/470055a0f970c3ad4972935ab5c7f83f.mp4?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and expand your сasino alone or jump into co-op with friends! Assign roles, divide tasks and make profit together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTERTAIN THE GUESTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/5350303116b4197c91453534b740da10.poster.avif?t=1785944700\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/5350303116b4197c91453534b740da10.webm?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/5350303116b4197c91453534b740da10.mp4?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes more than slots to make a fortune. Install bars, serve snacks, and provide entertainment to keep guests glued to their seats. Customize every detail to ensure they empty their wallets before they leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR YOUR EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/6927b8162ab7de01c243ba404ad6f265.poster.avif?t=1785944700\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/6927b8162ab7de01c243ba404ad6f265.webm?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/6927b8162ab7de01c243ba404ad6f265.mp4?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When chaos hits, grab your wrench and get to work. Fix smoking slot machines, replace busted parts, and keep the slots spinning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN THE WILDEST GAMBLING HOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/e7d6c7b53fdc84b4b6397ffcd0ee694a.poster.avif?t=1785944700\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/e7d6c7b53fdc84b4b6397ffcd0ee694a.webm?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/e7d6c7b53fdc84b4b6397ffcd0ee694a.mp4?t=1785944700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of running a casino where anything can happen? From fancy VIPs to vandals starting fires, every day brings hilarious problems to solve.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Friends to play with :D</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  IIntel Core i5-13600K or AMD Ryzen 5 5800X3D<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or AMD RX6600XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Friends to play with :D</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["Toxic Studio"],"publishers":["Toxic Studio","Polden Publishing"],"release_date":"May 21, 2026"}